"""
Dentrix Ascend Streaming Consumer
Connects to the Ascend AMQPS RabbitMQ stream and writes real-time events
to Supabase and a local SQLite events table (for SSE fan-out).

Routing key format: <OrgID>.<LocationID>.<ResourceType>.<Method>
Example:  6482308088c2a542e2dafd27.14000000000432.Appointment.Updated

Run as standalone process:
    python streaming_consumer.py

Or imported and started as a thread:
    from streaming_consumer import start_consumer_thread
    start_consumer_thread()
"""

